 PUNCH TAPE 5 ROUTINE        11691                                              
 THIS IS A PROGRAM TO READ TAPE 5                                               
  THEN PUNCH IT ON THE ON-LINE PUNCH                                            
* ASSEMBLE, PUNCH OBJECT                                        PT5  001        
       ABS                                                               PT5 001
       ORG 40                                                            PT5 002
 START WEF 5                                                             PT5 003
       REW 5                                                             PT5 004
 ENTRY LXA M1,2         SET UP FOR MACHINE SIZE                          PT5 005
       TIX *+1,2,LAST   OF MACHINE                                       PT5 006
 SIZE  CLA LAST                                                          PT5 007
       STA CALL                                                          PT5 008
 LOOP  LXA OUT,4                                                         PT5 009
       LXA OUT,1                                                         PT5 010
 READ  RTB 5                                                             PT5 011
       TXI *+1,1,1                                                       PT5 012
       TXH EOR,1,24                                                      PT5 013
       CPY 0,2                                                           PT5 014
       TXI *-3,2,-1     NORMAL                                           PT5 015
