       PXD 0,1                                                           PT5 050
       COM                                                               PT5 051
       STD *+2                                                           PT5 052
       TSX LR,4                                                          PT5 053
       PZE 10,,**                                                        PT5 054
       TRA LOOP                                                          PT5 055
 EOF   CLA STOP                                                          PT5 056
       STO TOP+1                                                         PT5 057
       TRA OUT                                                           PT5 058
 STOP  HPR 7,7                                                           PT5 059
UMRBCF EQU 8                                                             PT5 060
       REM  SUBROUTINE- READ REGULAR BINARY ON PERI,                     PT5 061
       REM              PUNCH CHINESE BINARY ON ATTACHED                 PT5 062
       REM  IMAGE ORIGINS. ADRESS-INPUT, DECREMENT-OUTPUT                PT5 063
       REM  GET 12+REGULAR AND 24+BINARY ORIGINS                         PT5 064
RC1    CAL 1,4                                                           PT5 065
